<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudan’s war has expanded to target its power grid, with attacks disrupting electricity nationwide and factories struggling to restart after wartime damage. The UN peacekeeping chief warned that RSF drone strikes launched from Ethiopian territory pose a new threat to civilians, prompting Ethiopia to expel six Sudanese consular staff and close Sudan’s consulate, while Sudan shut the Ethiopian consulate in retaliation. The conflict caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBpUkJMUXd2ZnU1ajhQY05SMTh6SUp3TDZ2aERkbU9GUjBoWDJ5RmRsQ2dieFJJWkx0RVY5YmlodTNIWU5RVFVRRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNMWFXZE53Y1NVelM1ZmljRDh3R3JGOHVlME1BZzZ1NmVlZHhHRmNCOEdjLVhobEtMYnVVM181QlNwYWhHM3hhNlBMT25vUjVnUTNYNlRSaFNOb2xMeEJpOUg1M1FfZzZoMzVWNTRKbnpEeUY0MkR1d0VKUmw0OHoxa3hwM0tfVlBVTXNSamVkNGtFVnJYZlM5SFNXUjJ1VDI5SFd5OVNSaWZwbzkydmdF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNQW1iNndNcXdOam1DRURFeDl2cExCRk43QXZVX3BUUnRBeWFDa2hTS1AzNnkteGFvUEJrRG5rek1nQlpGRkdMTURyOWFNcDFqc0xQLUpER0o3dElzMUxXSFJQMEwxSlE5ODVPVjZtTkFobHN1cUhMYkVlbHF0LXpRNldTdFhvMEN5SzVpYVJrQ1lSQ2hMWm5INkpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE12RzNmdnNRNWJmUWpwdk1VN3lmazV3cnZTN29KMENHRUNJZldMQXlwSl9yYUtmaDZDY0llVUJaMEtYRnJFVmU3WVdzdW5JVUtuQS0wZEJFcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPTlN4Z0NvUnBzSnd0SG9fbUx5Z25Xb19YalJBalpPVHpXZ29BUHJUem9aYTZWZkYwOGZxU1pwRXJvWEMweFhjQ0RIcWcwcHZHdUFIMXRSZHY0ZlZwZXh2bGFvTTJaUTB2OGV4SFdDX3h1YTh0clpIYU1JaWdEMk5LaUVs